---
// Post 12 (Backtest) figure: WalkForward. Inline SVG, site tokens only, no ids. Numbers come from the Python runs recorded in the post brief.
---
<figure class="atp12-walkforward">
  <div class="atp12-walkforward-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 358" role="img" aria-label="Walk-forward folds on 2,520 days: each fold trains on all earlier days and tests on the next 126 days. Folds 1, 2, 3 and 14 are drawn. The stitched test windows form one out-of-sample record of 1,764 days.">
<text x="20" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Walk-forward: always test on days the model has not seen</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Walk-forward: luôn kiểm tra trên những ngày mô hình chưa thấy</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="75" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Fold 1</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Lần 1</tspan></text>
<rect x="150.0" y="56" width="210.0" height="26" rx="3" class="box" />
<rect x="360.0" y="56" width="35.0" height="26" rx="3" class="goldf" />
<text x="20" y="115" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Fold 2</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Lần 2</tspan></text>
<rect x="150.0" y="96" width="245.0" height="26" rx="3" class="box" />
<rect x="395.0" y="96" width="35.0" height="26" rx="3" class="goldf" />
<text x="20" y="155" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Fold 3</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Lần 3</tspan></text>
<rect x="150.0" y="136" width="280.0" height="26" rx="3" class="box" />
<rect x="430.0" y="136" width="35.0" height="26" rx="3" class="goldf" />
<text x="150" y="198"><tspan data-lang-en>⋮</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>⋮</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="235" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Fold 14</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Lần 14</tspan></text>
<rect x="150.0" y="216" width="665.0" height="26" rx="3" class="box" />
<rect x="815.0" y="216" width="35.0" height="26" rx="3" class="goldf" />
<text x="20" y="284" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Test windows, stitched</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Các đoạn test ghép lại</tspan></text>
<rect x="360.0" y="266" width="490.0" height="26" rx="3" class="goldf" />
<line x1="150.0" y1="300" x2="150.0" y2="306" class="ax" />
<text x="150.0" y="322" text-anchor="middle" class="s">0</text>
<line x1="220.0" y1="300" x2="220.0" y2="306" class="ax" />
<text x="220.0" y="322" text-anchor="middle" class="s">1</text>
<line x1="290.0" y1="300" x2="290.0" y2="306" class="ax" />
<text x="290.0" y="322" text-anchor="middle" class="s">2</text>
<line x1="360.0" y1="300" x2="360.0" y2="306" class="ax" />
<text x="360.0" y="322" text-anchor="middle" class="s">3</text>
<line x1="430.0" y1="300" x2="430.0" y2="306" class="ax" />
<text x="430.0" y="322" text-anchor="middle" class="s">4</text>
<line x1="500.0" y1="300" x2="500.0" y2="306" class="ax" />
<text x="500.0" y="322" text-anchor="middle" class="s">5</text>
<line x1="570.0" y1="300" x2="570.0" y2="306" class="ax" />
<text x="570.0" y="322" text-anchor="middle" class="s">6</text>
<line x1="640.0" y1="300" x2="640.0" y2="306" class="ax" />
<text x="640.0" y="322" text-anchor="middle" class="s">7</text>
<line x1="710.0" y1="300" x2="710.0" y2="306" class="ax" />
<text x="710.0" y="322" text-anchor="middle" class="s">8</text>
<line x1="780.0" y1="300" x2="780.0" y2="306" class="ax" />
<text x="780.0" y="322" text-anchor="middle" class="s">9</text>
<line x1="850.0" y1="300" x2="850.0" y2="306" class="ax" />
<text x="850.0" y="322" text-anchor="middle" class="s">10</text>
<text x="500" y="342" class="s" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Years of daily data (10 years = 2,520 days)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Số năm dữ liệu ngày (10 năm = 2.520 ngày)</tspan></text>
<rect x="560" y="40" width="14" height="14" rx="6" class="box" />
<text x="582" y="52" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>train</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>huấn luyện</tspan></text>
<rect x="660" y="40" width="14" height="14" rx="6" class="okb" />
<rect x="660" y="40" width="14" height="14" rx="3" class="goldf" />
<text x="682" y="52" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>test (126 days)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>kiểm tra (126 ngày)</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Start with 756 days of training, test the next 126, then slide forward by 126: 14 folds. The stitched bar is 1,764 days of results no fold was tuned on.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Bắt đầu với 756 ngày huấn luyện, test 126 ngày kế, rồi trượt tới 126 ngày: 14 lần. Thanh ghép là 1.764 ngày kết quả mà không lần nào được chỉnh tham số trên đó.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .atp12-walkforward { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .atp12-walkforward-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .atp12-walkforward svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .atp12-walkforward text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .atp12-walkforward .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp12-walkforward .s { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp12-walkforward .t13 { font-size: 13px; }
  .atp12-walkforward .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp12-walkforward .redt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .atp12-walkforward .goldt { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .atp12-walkforward .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); }
  .atp12-walkforward .okb { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); }
  .atp12-walkforward .badb { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .atp12-walkforward .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; fill: none; }
  .atp12-walkforward .arrf { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp12-walkforward .ax { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; fill: none; }
  .atp12-walkforward .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 3 4; fill: none; }
  .atp12-walkforward .redl { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .atp12-walkforward .goldl { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .atp12-walkforward .mutl { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; fill: none; }
  .atp12-walkforward .redf { fill: var(--red); }
  .atp12-walkforward .goldf { fill: var(--gold); }
  .atp12-walkforward .mutf { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .atp12-walkforward .hole { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .atp12-walkforward figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
